esh ways to train, compete, and dominate. \n\n \n\n\ud83d\udd25 NEW in the Full Release:\n\n- \ud83d\udca5 Endlessly Replayable Career Mode -\nStart as a rookie and fight your way through the amateur ranks to the world tournament!\n\n- \ud83e\udde0 Adaptive AI Opponents -\nEngage with the most advanced single-player AI in the series!\n\n- \ud83d\udde3\ufe0fCoach Berg is Back -\nCoach Berg returns with over 2,000 lines of fully voiced dialogue to guide you through training, corner advice, and post-fight analysis.\n\n- \ud83d\udece\ufe0f New Boxing Arena - Memorial Hall -\nFight in a grand new boxing arena during the singleplayer career and in multiplayer!\n\n\n\n\ud83d\udcaa What to Expect: \n\n- \ud83c\udfae Precision-based VR boxing gameplay \n\n- \ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Fully customizable avatars \n\n- \ud83e\udd3c Online PvP via skill-based matchmaking or private matches \n\n- \ud83c\udf0d Immersive arenas with intense atmosphere \n\n\n\n**Get ready to sweat, strategize, and swing like never before. \nYou\u2019ve got the gloves\u2014now ask yourself: Who\u2019s next? \ud83e\udd47**\n\nJoin your fellow fans on our Discord: discord.gg/TheThrillOfTheFight2 ", "display_long_description_unprocessed": "\ud83e\udd4a The Thrill is Back \u2014 and Bigger Than Ever! \n\nStep back into the ring in Thrill of the Fight 2, the fully reimagined sequel to VR\u2019s most beloved boxing experience \u2014 now fully released with a brand new singleplayer career! \n\nWhether you're a seasoned fighter or just getting started, this update brings fresh ways to train, compete, and dominate. \n\n \n\n\ud83d\udd25 NEW in the Full Release:\n\n- \ud83d\udca5 Endlessly Replayable Career Mode -\nStart as a rookie and fight your way through the amateur ranks to the world tournament!\n\n- \ud83e\udde0 Adaptive AI Opponents -\nEngage with the most advanced single-player AI in the series!\n\n- \ud83d\udde3\ufe0fCoach Berg is Back -\nCoach Berg returns with over 2,000 lines of fully voiced d